GreyTheory AI is defensive security tooling. It governs whether security
research activity is authorised and records what happened; it does not scan,
exploit, or interact with any system on its own.

Use of this software does not grant authority to test any system. Authorisation
comes from a bug bounty or vulnerability disclosure programme, a contracted
engagement, ownership of the target, or a deliberately vulnerable local lab —
never from this tool. See SECURITY.md and Docs/scope-policy.md.
